    "created_at": "2018-02-14T17:21:57Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-02-14T17:21:57Z",
    "body": "I don't have links offhand, sorry.  It's the general \"should there be eager or lazy typechecking\" problem that's been discussed a few times on es-discuss and public-script-coord.  And probably in person in TC39 and private discussions....\r\n\r\nSome of this is referenced in the long discussion at https://github.com/heycam/webidl/issues/345 (again, no links there).  There are references to it in the TAG feedback issue.",
